data: {"type":"TOOL_CALL_RESULT","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-b4d53de3a465c8be","messageId":"0c3d174a-6f39-46dd-9b8c-a62e5f610e67","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"result\":{\"status\":\"available\",\"referenceOnly\":true,\"creatorVersion\":\"0.0.1\",\"versions\":{\"@za38.03/agent-ui-core\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-renderer\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-runtime\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-plugins\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-web-component\":\"0.0.1\",\"@za38.03/agent-ui-creator\":\"0.0.1\"},\"sourceDigest\":\"59c94751aad6e7f3db824614fc9732efc2bf1036a2c36b0885cc14a735d60a76\",\"query\":\"application events usePluginEvents agent-events\",\"total\":118,\"offset\":0,\"entries\":[{\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"title\":\"插件开发接口\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/plugin-api.md\",\"summary\":\"项目插件由能力声明、组件和可选的服务生命周期组成。创建文件与注册步骤见创建自定义插件。修改已有官方插件外观时，先使用组件公开属性。\",\"sha256\":\"cd30e68bc788dd22fdccc937313217ed5e3c3816b86e84f9138f758709423720\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s316\",\"title\":\"订阅业务事件\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s316\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s5\",\"title\":\"公共能力速查\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s5\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s22\",\"title\":\"类型入口\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/plugin-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s22\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"internal:agent-ui-plugin-creator-launch-plan\",\"title\":\"Agent UI Plugin Creator 架构与执行边界\",\"source\":\"internal\",\"topic\":\"职责与所有权\",\"path\":\"references/docs/agent-ui-plugin-creator-launch-plan.md\",\"summary\":\"当前架构：Creator、AppUIModel、Plugin、Runtime、AG-UI、Service 和交付边界。\",\"sha256\":\"2a7020bd5c6879c9c1e4d472051e485251bacf4fb88172a7fdcacd9df56d492e\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:agent-ui-plugin-creator-launch-plan\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s30\",\"title\":\"项目应用层、实现与 Shell\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:agent-ui-plugin-creator-launch-plan\",\"sectionId\":\"s30\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s5\",\"title\":\"职责与交付\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:agent-ui-plugin-creator-launch-plan\",\"sectionId\":\"s5\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s53\",\"title\":\"会话与 Agent 交互\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"internal:agent-ui-plugin-creator-launch-plan\",\"sectionId\":\"s53\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/frontend-tools\",\"title\":\"前端工具与自定义工具 UI\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/frontend-tools.md\",\"summary\":\"前端工具让 Agent 请求执行页面动作，例如打开弹窗或填写表单。业务应用决定哪些动作可用，并提供执行方法；工具 UI 只显示参数、状态和结果。\",\"sha256\":\"550e6db69213972586b6cd11791825e70f39e2bd6dc2a0832e4f6b6ca832f142\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/frontend-tools\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s13\",\"title\":\"宿主页面操作接入\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/frontend-tools\",\"sectionId\":\"s13\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s5\",\"title\":\"接入需求示例\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/frontend-tools\",\"sectionId\":\"s5\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"前端工具与自定义工具 UI\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/frontend-tools\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/layout-and-composition\",\"title\":\"布局与插件组合\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/layout-and-composition.md\",\"summary\":\"Agent UI 把会话列表、输入框、附件、复制等功能做成了插件。你可以按需启用、调整位置，也可以把多个插件组合起来。 本页说明如何手动修改布局配置。界面排列、插件实例及组合保存在 app-ui.json 中，组件属性和渲染代码放在项目插件入口。 日常调整可以直接把需求告诉 Creator，见布局调整示例。自己编辑时，先找到下文的配置文件，保留现有实例 ID，再按需修改位置、尺寸和组合。\",\"sha256\":\"472d2f6ae3449c0e8c1ef05791cfaf3213aab0fcb226ba8eda9037c9ef804047\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/layout-and-composition\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s187\",\"title\":\"布局与尺寸\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/layout-and-composition\",\"sectionId\":\"s187\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s97\",\"title\":\"布局与组合配置\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/layout-and-composition\",\"sectionId\":\"s97\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s24\",\"title\":\"插件使用方式\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/layout-and-composition\",\"sectionId\":\"s24\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/project-structure\",\"title\":\"工程结构与修改入口\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/project-structure.md\",\"summary\":\"初始化后，Agent UI 源码默认放在 src/agent-ui/。以下路径都相对于这个目录；初始化时选择了其他目录，就在实际目录中找同名文件。 不同版本或历史工程的目录可能不同，先检查已有组件的导入和导出。官方插件通常由项目入口导入 npm 实现；已经接管的插件则引用本地实现。 新工程只生成布局中选用的插件入口，以及读取服务、传入数据和显示子插件所需的代码，添加插件时再生成对应入口。已经存在的项目入口会保留。 服务相关 Hook 统一放在 services/hooks/ 下：useConversations.ts、useConversationActions.ts 和按需生成的 useAu\",\"sha256\":\"d12f5d52751a6ac2fdd49c8a308ac1b080e59b0cf6076e91bbf7ffaa729b73db\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/project-structure\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s1\",\"title\":\"工程结构与修改入口\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/project-structure\",\"sectionId\":\"s1\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s25\",\"title\":\"根据修改目标选择入口\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/project-structure\",\"sectionId\":\"s25\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/attachments-dictation-feedback\",\"title\":\"附件、语音与评价服务\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/attachments-dictation-feedback.md\",\"summary\":\"通用能力已有默认实现。接入自己的服务时，通过 Agent 的 attachments、dictation、feedback 属性传入配置。也可以把接口说明交给 Creator 完成。\",\"sha256\":\"5f45a1a3339e56bd983bc715546053216a3e83c8b333b3603adba2f0d899f92f\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/attachments-dictation-feedback\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s19\",\"title\":\"反馈\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/attachments-dictation-feedback\",\"sectionId\":\"s19\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s5\",\"title\":\"附件\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/attachments-dictation-feedback\",\"sectionId\":\"s5\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s25\",\"title\":\"手动配置示例\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/attachments-dictation-feedback\",\"sectionId\":\"s25\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:development/react-host-api\",\"title\":\"React 页面参数与方法\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开发文档\",\"path\":\"development/react-host-api.md\",\"summary\":\"AgentUIProvider 让业务组件与助理共享同一个会话。业务组件通过 useAgentUI() 发送消息、停止生成或新建会话，通过状态和事件 Hooks 更新页面。接入步骤、截图和完整代码见业务页面与 Agent 联动。\",\"sha256\":\"9bdc1d543a8d2af728da7757972ba7d35b76c8cba1bd9be1c4619aa3962e92ff\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/react-host-api\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s170\",\"title\":\"外壳定制\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/react-host-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s170\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s14\",\"title\":\"Agent 属性表\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/react-host-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s14\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s139\",\"title\":\"订阅 Agent 业务事件\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:development/react-host-api\",\"sectionId\":\"s139\"}}}]},{\"documentId\":\"public:start/index\",\"title\":\"开始使用\",\"source\":\"public\",\"topic\":\"开始使用\",\"path\":\"start/index.md\",\"summary\":\"为你的产品加入 AI 助理，用自然语言调整界面。从现有 React 工程出发，完成接入、首次对话和第一次定制。\",\"sha256\":\"11355dee8e8f6d796be9f50499c23a9ba7a038530da015a286f66070a752a125\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:start/index\"}},\"matchingSections\":[{\"sectionId\":\"s89\",\"title\":\"选择模板和源码位置\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:start/index\",\"sectionId\":\"s89\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s163\",\"title\":\"生成了哪些文件\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:start/index\",\"sectionId\":\"s163\"}}},{\"sectionId\":\"s267\",\"title\":\"接入业务 Agent\",\"nextRead\":{\"tool\":\"read_creator_documentation\",\"input\":{\"action\":\"read\",\"documentId\":\"public:start/index\",\"sectionId\":\"s267\"}}}]}],\"nextOffset\":8}}","role":"tool"}

